## Highlighting

Standard green/yellow/red system per Notion Posting SOP. 30%+ coverage target.

### Colour Application in Briefing Context

| Colour | Briefing meaning | Examples |
|--------|-----------------|----------|
| `green_bg` | Strong conviction points, confirmed hypotheses, clear positive signals, exciting angles | "Richard sees a clear demand-driven EPSU setup", "Management quality flagged as strong at IG" |
| `yellow_bg` | Open questions, uncertain areas, things to test, conditional views | "Unclear whether margin expansion is structural or cyclical", "Needs KQ on regulatory timeline" |
| `red_bg` | Risks flagged, known weaknesses, concerns, potential deal-breakers | "False friend risk on revenue visibility", "Balance sheet leverage a concern", "Richard worried about customer concentration" |

**Highlight the specific sentences that carry signal — not whole paragraphs.** Same precision rules as all Notion postings.

