## Formatting

**Load and follow the Notion Posting Format Standard** (`memory/skills/notion-posting-standard/SKILL.md`). Key requirements:

- **BLUF:** Page-level (3-5 bullets) and section-level (italic opening sentences)
- **IAJA tags:** Suffix bullets with #J, #A, #I, #T, #O, #KR, #OQ
- **J→A→I ordering:** Judgement first in parent bullets, analysis and data in sub-bullets
- **Headers:** Proportional to length per Format Standard §7. The required sections above provide the H2 skeleton.
- **Bold:** All financial metrics, stock names, key terms, conclusions, conviction statements
- **Bullets:** Parent + sub-bullet structure. Shorter sentences. 100-word cap.
- **Italic summaries:** Section-closing italic sentence at each H2
- **Dividers:** `---` between major sections

