## Notion Page Properties

```
Note title: [W] {TICKER} - {Stage} - Briefing Note - {5-15 word summary} [W] @ DD-Mon-YY
date:Date:start: YYYY-MM-DD (date of the briefing)
date:Date:is_datetime: 0
Main focus of note: Stock(s)
Info, analysis, judgement and/or action: ["Analysis", "Judgement", "Action needed - Research"]
Depth of note: Watson back-brief
Case component: (leave blank — briefing notes span all case components)
Stock(s): https://www.notion.so/{stock_page_id_no_dashes}
```

**Title convention (updated 16-Apr-26):** `[W]` prefix (Watson output). `[W]` source suffix (Watson-synthesised). Stage = "ESA" or "DD P1" or "DD RO". Summary = **5-15 word substantive descriptor** of the research direction and central thesis agreed in the brief. Company name NOT included.

**Examples:**
- `[W] GET - ESA - Briefing Note - Hospital equipment recovery play; fulcrum driver is surgical volumes recovery post-COVID backlog clearing; margin rebuild secondary thesis [W] @ 13-Apr-26`
- `[W] DCC - DD P1 - Briefing Note - Energy distribution conglomerate; management quality and capital allocation discipline are the key DD focus areas [W] @ 15-Apr-26`
- `[W] CARLB - DD RO - Briefing Note - Emerging market FX exposure and hedging strategy resolution; secondary focus on pricing power sustainability [W] @ 20-Apr-26`

